 "answer": "CD-10420: Password Reset Email Not Received\n\nDear Customer,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding the password reset issue. We understand this can be frustrating when the reset email does not arrive.\n\nAccording to our article [1], if you request a password reset but do not receive the email, it's recommended to wait a few minutes before attempting again. Additionally, please check the following:\n\n- Ensure your email address is correctly entered during the reset process.\n- Verify that your organization\u2019s email server is not blocking CloudDesk emails.\n- Check your spam or junk folders.\n\nIf none of these solutions resolve the issue, we recommend contacting our support team directly at [support-email]. They can provide more personalized assistance and help troubleshoot any specific issues you might encounter.\n\nWe apologize for any inconvenience",
